OL,3,GNEWSAMan loses legal case against US
OL,4,Aextradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottinghamshire entrepreneur accused
OL,7,Fof defrauding the US healthcare system
OL,8,Fhas lost a legal battle against
OL,9,Fextradition.
OL,11,FThe US authorities want to put Sukhi
OL,12,FGhuman and his ex-wife Kiranjit on
OL,13,Ftrial over charges relating to cancer
OL,14,Fclinics they bought in Arizona and
OL,15,FCalifornia after they were accused of
OL,16,Fsmuggling drugs into the country.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
