OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1794581787
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan loses legal case against US
OL,4,Aextradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FMr Ghuman, 48, of Syerston Hall near
OL,7,FNewark, denies involvement and said he
OL,8,Fwas not medically fit to be extradited,
OL,9,Fbut a hearing at Westminster
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court on Friday ruled
OL,11,Fagainst him, meaning the Home Secretary
OL,12,Fcan approve his extradition.
OL,14,FThe district judge found Ms Ghuman,
OL,15,Falso 48, should not be extradited on
OL,16,Fhuman rights grounds.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
